1) ViewerTabBar renders as a vertical icon rail:
  ok rail-owned pages get no row, plain tabs do
  ok the inbox tab is not drawn as a row
  ok bar carries the rail class
  ok bar announces a vertical tablist
  ok every tab shows an icon
  ok every tab keeps its label in the DOM (hidden by CSS until hover)
  ok the rail wraps the tabs, not the other way round
2) markup + CSS keep the rail fixed on the pane's right edge:
  ok the pane body wraps the header
  ok the header (rail) comes after the content in the body
  ok the rail block exists in the stylesheet
  ok rail stacks its tabs vertically
  ok rail is pinned to the pane's right edge at a fixed width
  ok the rail is never a window drag region
  FAIL hovering never widens the rail or repaints it [
  '.viewer-pane-body .viewer-tabs-rail .editor-tab.viewer-tab:hover {\n' +
    '  transform: none;\n' +
    '}',
  '.viewer-pane-body .viewer-tabs-rail .editor-tab.viewer-tab:hover,\n' +
    '.viewer-pane-body .viewer-tabs-rail .editor-tab.viewer-tab:focus-visible {\n' +
    '  color: var(--text);\n' +
    '  background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--text) 14%, var(--bg-hover));\n' +
    '  border-color: color-mix(in srgb, currentColor 22%, transparent);\n' +
    '}',
  '.viewer-pane-body .viewer-tabs-rail .editor-tab:hover .editor-tab-close,\n' +
    '.viewer-pane-body .viewer-tabs-rail .editor-tab:focus-visible .editor-tab-close,\n' +
    '.viewer-pane-body .viewer-tabs-rail .editor-tab:focus-within .editor-tab-close {\n' +
    '  opacity: 1;\n' +
    '  pointer-events: auto;\n' +
    '}',
  '.viewer-pane-body .viewer-tabs-rail .editor-tab .editor-tab-close:hover {\n' +
    '  transform: translate(-50%, -50%) scale(1.08);\n' +
    '  color: var(--danger);\n' +
    '  background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--danger) 18%, transparent);\n' +
    '}',
  '.viewer-pane-body .viewer-tabs-rail .editor-tab:hover .viewer-tab-icon,\n' +
    '.viewer-pane-body .viewer-tabs-rail .editor-tab:focus-visible .viewer-tab-icon,\n' +
    '.viewer-pane-body .viewer-tabs-rail .editor-tab:focus-within .viewer-tab-icon {\n' +
